$ A grounded scalar spring: CELAS4 with its second point blank is a spring k = 10 from scalar point 1001 to ground.
$ A unit SLOAD on 1001 gives u = 1 / 10 = 0.1 (hand value).
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = GROUNDED CELAS4
LOAD = 1
DISPLACEMENT = ALL
BEGIN BULK
SPOINT,1001
CELAS4,1,10.,1001
SLOAD,1,1001,1.
ENDDATA
